SUMMARY:Mohanad Elshieky
DESCRIPTION:Known for his sharp wit and understated delivery\, Libyan-born and New York-based comedian Mohanad Elshieky offers a fresh\, incisive take on politics and culture. \nHe has appeared on Conan\, Comedy Central\, and The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, and is a writer and consultant for the podcast Lovett or Leave It. He was also a host of Lemonada Media’s Webby-nominated podcast I’M SORRY. \nPraised by The Portland Mercury as “an undisputed genius of comedy\,” his work blends smart\, pointed humor with thoughtful commentary that leaves a lasting impression.
