SUMMARY:Kids\, Teen\, + Maternity Consignment Pop-Up
DESCRIPTION:Parents save 50-90% on quality kids\, teen\, & maternity at JBF Vacaville Fairfield’s huge consignment pop-up! Never overpay for something your kids will outgrow again. Shop\, sell\, and save smart May 28-31 only! \nParents\, here’s what you can expect to find at our Spring into Summer event:\nClothes for babies\, kids + teens\nMaternity items\nShoes\nToys\, books + games\nStrollers and car seats\nBaby gear\nCamping + outdoor\nSwimwear + swim toys\nTravel gear\n& more! \nHow to shop:\nJoin us on Presale Day (5/28) for first access to the biggest selection we have to offer! Presale shopping is limited—get tickets & reserve your spot to shop. You can also choose to shop for free during public hours\, but you still need to get a ticket on our website ($3 at the door without a ticket). Children are always free to join you! Get tickets on our website\, vacaville.jbfsale.com. \nGot your ticket? Get ready to shop! We pop-up twice a year so you can get everything for the season ahead. \nReady to sell items you no longer need? Join more than 100 local families making money and clearing clutter—plus you get FIRST access to the merchandise & the BEST deals as a perk! Get more info at vacaville.jbfsale.com \n  \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/kids-teen-maternity-consignment-pop-up/2026-05-30/
LOCATION:JBF Vacaville Fairfield\, 6391 Leisure Town Rd.\, Vacaville\, CA\, 95687\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Shopping
ORGANIZER;CN="Just Between Friends Vacaville":MAILTO:elenahickey@jbfsale.com
END:VEVENT
